head='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#321c2d"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\' viewBox=\'0 0 64 64\'%3E%3Crect width=\'64\' height=\'64\' rx=\'12\' fill=\'%23321c2d\'/%3E%3Ctext x=\'32\' y=\'43\' text-anchor=\'middle\' font-family=\'Georgia\' font-size=\'31\' fill=\'%23f5eee9\'%3ESK%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">'''
